<AddOnInstructionDefinitions Use="Context">
<EncodedData EncodedType="AddOnInstructionDefinition" Name="SeqCtrl_Protected" Class="Standard" Revision="3.3" SignatureID="38ADB3F7" SignatureTimestamp="2026-11-22T05:35:29.637Z" EditedDate="2026-11-22T05:35:29.637Z" SoftwareRevision="v37.00" EncryptionConfig="9">
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[v3.3 Fixed bug where state bits and step where out of sync for 1 scan
v3.2 fixed bug where first scan would not init to aborted
v3.1 add state back in and inActiveState outputs and fixed abortVisible bug
v3.0 Major overhaul of states, cmds, UDTs, etc. See AIC Wiki for details.
...]]>
</RevisionNote>
